## Issues

- [ ] `description` is ~1,607 chars (cap 200) — packs the two-step plan, the
  bundled template default, the four entry-point artifact names with paths,
  the typed-key list, the retired step-builder names, and the no-`brainPath`
  invariant. Trim to ≤200 chars.
  Traces to: `description` field | Brevity Contract caps + Forbidden content (function names, file paths, retired prior designs)
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Brevity, Forbidden-content

- [ ] `intent` is ~496 words (cap 100). Restates the description with added
  paragraphs about no-disk-write, the two callers, the retired step builder
  list, the arg-index-slot-knowledge invariant. Trim to ≤100 words.
  Traces to: `intent` field | Brevity Contract caps + Forbidden content
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Brevity, Forbidden-content

- [ ] `outcomes.desired` has 10 items (cap 4); each is paragraph length and
  encodes function names (`buildBrainAideStep`, `buildBrainMcpStep`), exact
  artifact paths, exact `aide_init({ category: "brain" })` call shape, the
  parser key list, and the retired-step-builder enumeration.
  Traces to: `outcomes.desired` | Brevity Contract caps + Forbidden content
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Brevity, Forbidden-content

- [ ] `outcomes.undesired` has ~12 paragraph-length items, almost all citing
