  `buildPlaybookStep`, `buildStudyPlaybookStep`, `buildUpdatePlaybookStep`,
  `buildResearchStep`, `PATH_SLOT_INDEX`, `resolveBrainRoot`, the legacy
  obsidian MCP key migration). Forbidden content.
  Traces to: `outcomes.undesired` | Brevity Contract caps + Forbidden content
